tunity to discover new charms and experiences. Despite its smaller size among other Spanish islands, being just around 48 km (30 miles) long and around 16 km (10 miles) wide, the number of beaches that Menorca has equals the number of beaches that can be found in Mallorca and Ibiza combined.","grounding":[{"source":"wikivoyage","title":"Menorca","url":"https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Menorca","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}],"short":"Menorca is the quiet one of the Balearic Islands, in Spain, and a UNESCO biosphere reserve. The Cami de Cavalls coast path and the Talati de Dalt stones are the draws, with Cala Mitjana for a swim. June to August is the season.","short_src":"rewrite","facts":{"population":29125,"visit_h":5}},"highlights":[{"id":"hl-playa-santo-tomas","name":"Playa Santo Tomás","kind":"Beach","lat":39.91372,"lon":4.04128,"dist_km":18.3,"rank_score":7.19,"resolved_by":"catalogue","image":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/83/Sant_Tom%C3%A0s_%282_de_agosto_de_2015%2C_es_Migjorn_Gran%29.jpg/960px-Sant_Tom%C3%A0s_%282_de_agosto_de_2015%2C_es_Migjorn_Gran%29.jpg","author":"Discasto","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licence_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sant_Tom%C3%A0s_(2_de_agosto_de_2015,_es_Migjorn_Gran).jpg","w":3840,"h":2160,"ok_print":true}},{"id":"hl-colom-island","name":"Colom Island","kind":"Island","lat":39.958,"lon":4.278,"dist_km":9.3,"rank_score":6.98,"resolved_by":"catalogue","image":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5a/Illa_d%27en_Colom.jpg/960px-Illa_d%27en_Colom.jpg","author":"Carles garcia-roca, carles_garcia_roca@hotmail.com","licence":"CC BY 2.5 es","licence_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.5/es/deed.en","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Illa_d'en_Colom.jpg","w":2048,"h":1536,"ok_print":true}},{"id":"hl-st-philip-s-castle","name":"St. Philip's Castle","kind":"Castle","lat":39.8653,"lon":4.30569,"dis